        <mj-text>
          <h1>Still no event &mdash; can we help?</h1>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="14px 0 0 0">
          Hi { $recipient_first_name }, this is the last reminder in this series. If sending a first webhook has not clicked yet, something is usually in the way, and we would rather unblock it than let your account go quiet.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-button href="{ $discord_url_tracked }" align="left" padding="20px 0 16px 0">Ask the community on Discord</mj-button>
        <mj-text padding="16px 0 0 0" font-size="14px" color="#475569" line-height="1.6">
          Prefer email? Reach us directly at <a href="mailto:{ $support_email_address }" style="font-weight:600;">{ $support_email_address }</a> and a human will help you get the first event through.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="16px 0 0 0" font-size="13px" color="#64748b" line-height="1.6">
          Not the right time? No problem &mdash; we will stop these first-steps reminders here.
        </mj-text>
